# ─── Generated build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw electron-builder output. Wiped and rebuilt by `npm run dist`, never
# shipped directly: setup.bat must not live here, because that command empties
# the directory.
build/

# ─── Generated deliverable ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Assembled from build/ + share/ by `npm run share`. This is what gets handed to
# someone else, so these are ~368MB of binaries that must never enter history.
DSH-Launcher/
DSH-Launcher.zip

# ─── Dependencies ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ─── Legacy output directory ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kept so an older checkout does not start tracking 368MB after the build/ split.
out/

# ─── Local experiments and scratch output ────────────────────────────────────
# preview-icons.png is written by `npm run preview-icons`.
# .dsh-launcher-* covers anything the launcher or a probe drops in the tree.
preview-icons.png
.dsh-launcher-*
dist/
*.log
